<section id="laboratorio">
  <div class="hp-wrap">
    <div class="hp-section-head hp-reveal">
      <p class="hp-eyebrow">Laboratory</p>
      <h2>Computing infrastructure</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="hp-reveal">
      <p class="hp-hero-sub" style="color:var(--text-secondary);max-width:65ch">
        Our group operates on the USACH HPC Platform (FONDEQUIP 2023), equipped with high-performance computing clusters for numerical simulations and deep learning models. We process satellite data from Van Allen Probes, THEMIS, GOES and MMS with open source tools (Python, pandas, scikit-learn, PyTorch).
      </p>
    </div>
    <a class="hp-more" href="/en/lab">See full infrastructure &rarr;</a>
  </div>
